This project is a modern Fortran translation of the computational portions of
kdensity 1.2.0 by Jonas Moss and Martin Tveten.

The original package is distributed under the MIT License. The original source
and archive are retained under upstream/ for provenance.

The Fortran implementation is an independent translation. No code from the
univariateML dependency is copied into this package. Common parametric starts
are implemented locally, and custom starts can be supplied through procedure
pointers.
